  "scope": "Conditional shaft-rate budgets from the shared CAD closure Jacobian and effective actuator model. No-load speed is a design budget, not a hard backdrive limit. Frozen-pose return bounds omit varying geometry, lifting, acceleration, torque, friction and stability. Static support uses explicit point forces with contact disabled only for the audit: minimum-norm allocation is a candidate, not an optimized feasibility proof; contact height differences are reported, not resolved. Constant-static-torque rate screens omit velocity and acceleration loads. The sampled linear joint reference bound applies only to uniform time scaling of that reference. None is a global attainable speed proof."
